---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base solid title="About Us | Taste of 1952 | Mavalli Biryani Jayanagar" description="How Mavalli's Karnataka biryani is cooked on wood fire, now at the Jayanagar outlet." crumbs={[['About Us','/about/']]}>
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1440px] items-start gap-10 px-5 lg:px-12 pb-20 pt-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_1fr]">
    <div><h1 class="h-rule font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl">The Mavalli story</h1>
      <div class="mt-6 max-w-[65ch] space-y-4">
        <p>Mavalli Biryani carries the line "Taste of 1952". It is a Karnataka wood-fire restaurant name, built on one idea: biryani cooked slowly over a real fire. This is our Jayanagar outlet, a franchise outlet of Mavalli Biryani, cooking that same style for Bengaluru's south side.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl text-copper">Cooked on wood fire</h2>
        <p>Every handi is cooked in hammered copper over wood fire, not gas. The fire is slower and gentler. The rice and meat cook together, and the smoke stays in the pot.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl text-copper">Our own masala</h2>
        <p>The spice blend is the outlet recipe, mixed for biryani. We use jeera samba rice, the small fragrant grain Karnataka biryani is known for, and mutton on the bone.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl text-copper">Karnataka style, with green masala curry</h2>
        <p>Karnataka-style biryani is not the same as other regional styles. Alongside it we serve green masala curry, the gravy that goes best with it.</p>
        <h2 class="pt-4 font-display text-2xl text-copper">Visit, pick up or order</h2>
        <p>Come in for a meal, pick up a handi, or order for a party or office. The details are on the <a class="underline" href="/order/">order page</a>, and bulk orders go through the <a class="underline" href="/catering/">catering page</a>. You can find us on the <a class="underline" href="/contact/">contact page</a>.</p>
      </div></div>
    <figure class="grid place-items-center rounded-xl bg-ink p-8"><img src="/img/logo.webp" alt="Mavalli Biryani crest" width="900" height="582" loading="lazy" class="w-full max-w-sm"></figure>
  </div>
</Base>
